# Version Control
**/.git

# Development Configuration
**/.env*
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile*

# Documentation and Tests
**/docs
**/tests
**/*.md
!streamget/README.md

# Build Artifacts and Cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
**/node_modules
**/venv

# IDE Files
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Static Assets (Adjust as needed)
**/.iconset/
**/*.icns
# Exclude large desktop-only images from the Docker context, but keep the web sidebar logo
assets/images/*
!assets/images/logo-mark.svg
# Offline fallback fonts are downloaded during the build (scripts/download_fallback_fonts.py);
# exclude any locally-downloaded copies to keep the build context lean and non-stale.
# (AlibabaPuHuiTi is kept — it is an app font baked into the image via COPY . .)
assets/fonts/noto*/